WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.270 --> 00:00:03.000
Merry Christmas, Clara.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:03.800
Godfather!

00:00:05.410 --> 00:00:09.000
Your gift this year will be something you'll never forget.

00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:16.000
Most people don't realize there are troubled realms within our world

00:00:22.610 --> 00:00:28.800
and you hold the key to their secrets.

00:00:34.070 --> 00:00:37.200
Remember, Clara. Nothing is as it seems.

00:00:38.829 --> 00:00:39.800
Where am I?

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:42.600
You're in the Four Realms, Princess Clara

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:44.489
Princess?

00:00:44.489 --> 00:00:45.800
At your service, your majesty.

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:48.200
Maybe I have been spending too much time in the attic.

00:00:50.469 --> 00:00:52.329
Welcome to our world!

00:00:52.329 --> 00:00:54.329
The land of snowflakes,

00:00:54.640 --> 00:00:56.640
The land of flowers,

00:00:56.829 --> 00:00:58.829
And the land of sweets!

00:00:59.229 --> 00:01:01.229
But in the fourth realm,

00:01:01.829 --> 00:01:03.829
This is where our troubles began.

00:01:04.070 --> 00:01:06.300
Mother ginger started this war.

00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:08.300
Don't you know it's dangerous here?

00:01:10.610 --> 00:01:12.700
I hope you'll be the one to finish it.

00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:14.500
It's time to save the kingdom

00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:16.800
It's just the laws of physics

00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:18.500
Do those laws always work?

00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:19.800
As far as I know

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:20.800
Ready? Go!

00:01:32.250 --> 00:01:34.200
She's gathering her forces.

00:01:34.200 --> 00:01:36.700
You're the only one who can stop her

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:39.300
[Yelp] Hang on!

00:01:40.970 --> 00:01:43.000
I've been expecting you

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:49.200
It's time

00:02:09.210 --> 00:02:11.210
You

